<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edged down to 1.81 from 1.80 per dlr in Ki.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edged down to 1.81 from 1.80 per dlr in Ki.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.81 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.80 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    October 30	   October 29</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.81		   1.80</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $20.430 million	  $12.650 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
